eds would yield a crop containing 50% homozygous plants.\n     A   none of them\n     B   1 only\n     C   2 only\n     D   3 only\n     E   1 and 2 only\n     F   1 and 3 only\n     G   2 and 3 only\n     H   1, 2 and 3\n                                                    56\n\f                                                                                        PART D Biology",
