 factor is    the limiting factor                        the limiting factor is\n          is substrate                                  temperature              is substrate                                temperature\n         concentration                                                          concentration\n        the                              the          the           the         the                             the         the         the\n     indicator                        indicator    indicator     indicator   indicator                       indicator   indicator   indicator\n     changes                          changes      changes       changes     changes                         changes     changes     changes\n     due to an                        due to a     due to an     due to a    due to an                       due to a    due to an   due to a\n     increase                         decrease     increase      decrease    increase                        decrease    increase    decrease\n       in pH                            in pH        in pH         in pH       in pH                           in pH       in pH       in pH\n                  A                       B            C            D                E                          F           G             H\n                                                                        59\n\f                                                                                         PART D Biology",
